      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不瞒你说，我看到市里的\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>石头馆<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>正在出售2个化石。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
